# MCP + webview contracts

## MCP tools (v1) — no open_artboard

- set_artboard — create/init; may set active / open panel
- update_artboard — requires baseGeneration; conflict on mismatch
- read_artboard / list_artboards / set_active_artboard
- export_artboard / handoff_status

Serialize writes per artboard id. MCP denied: edit .cursor-design/** and tell user to allowlist.

## Disk (user workspace)

.cursor-design/manifest.json, artboards/<id>.html, optional meta, assets/, tokens.json, handoff/<exportId>/

Multi-artboard + one active. No gallery. Gitignore .cursor-design/.

## Webview CSP

1. Never eval artboard HTML in parent chrome.
2. Nested iframe sandbox allow-scripts; artboard JS required.
3. Iframe to chrome postMessage is untrusted.
4. asWebviewUri + localResourceRoots.
5. Messages: artboard:updated|error, ui:status|export|reveal.

## Stack

- Host: TS + esbuild
- Chrome: Svelte 5 + Vite (no Kit)
- MCP: `@modelcontextprotocol/server` (v2), not `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`
